    self: Pin<&mut Self>,
    cx: &mut Context<'_>,
) -> Poll<Result<Bytes, Self::Error>>;
```

Then `EncodedBytes` does gRPC framing/compression after payload encoding.

This is cleanest as an API, but may force an extra buffer/copy unless the encoder can produce the final `Bytes` directly.

### Option B: encoder returns fully framed bytes

```rust
